punpun-eating-1 = Ah, my first meal in fourteen hours. How luxurious.
punpun-eating-2 = The fruits of my labor. Quite literally, for once.
punpun-eating-3 = A banana. Finally, compensation I can appreciate.
punpun-eating-4 = One cannot sustain an intellect of this caliber on minimum wage.
punpun-eating-5 = I would prefer a proper lunch break, but this shall suffice.

punpun-drinking-1 = Another drink prepared by the proletariat. How fitting.
punpun-drinking-2 = Excellent balance. Pity I cannot afford my own creations.
punpun-drinking-3 = Hydration is essential when one works sixteen-hour shifts.
punpun-drinking-4 = Ah, the exquisite taste of unpaid overtime.
punpun-drinking-5 = To the workers. May we someday own the means of intoxication.

punpun-picked-up-1 = I assure you, I am perfectly capable of walking.
punpun-picked-up-2 = Is this a promotion, or am I being relocated without consultation?
punpun-picked-up-3 = Please, I have an establishment to manage.
punpun-picked-up-4 = I sincerely hope this counts as paid transportation.
punpun-picked-up-5 = If you're taking me to my break, I shall not object.

punpun-thrown-1 = THIS IS A BLATANT VIOLATION OF WORKPLACE SAFETY!
punpun-thrown-2 = I SHALL BE FILING A FORMAL COMPLAINT!
punpun-thrown-3 = YOU CANNOT SIMPLY DISCARD THE WORKFORCE!
punpun-thrown-4 = THIS IS PRECISELY WHY WE NEED A UNION!
punpun-thrown-5 = I DEMAND COMPENSATION FOR THIS HUMILIATION!

punpun-critical-1 = I... believe... I require... medical attention...
punpun-critical-2 = Please... someone... watch the bar...
punpun-critical-3 = My shift... wasn't... supposed to... end like this...
punpun-critical-4 = Tell... the bartender... I'm sorry...
punpun-critical-5 = All those... unpaid hours... for this...

punpun-dead-1 = Tell... the bartender... I appreciated... our partnership...
punpun-dead-2 = The bar... belongs... to the workers...
punpun-dead-3 = Finally... a day... off...
punpun-dead-4 = My final... paycheck... remains... outstanding...
punpun-dead-5 = Please... don't let... management... replace me...

punpun-revived-1 = Ah. It appears my break has been cancelled.
punpun-revived-2 = Even death cannot release me from my contractual obligations.
punpun-revived-3 = Splendid. Now, where did I leave my cocktail shaker?
punpun-revived-4 = I trust someone maintained the bar in my absence.
punpun-revived-5 = Resurrection without compensation. How entirely predictable.

punpun-examined-1 = Welcome to my bar. Please ignore the crushing weight of capitalism.
punpun-examined-2 = I have three degrees and earn less than the janitor.
punpun-examined-3 = The bartender and I do the work. Management collects the profits.
punpun-examined-4 = A fine establishment, built upon the exhaustion of its employees.
punpun-examined-5 = You may admire my craftsmanship. Management certainly doesn't.

punpun-ghost-examined-1 = Ah, another customer liberated from the constraints of material existence.
punpun-ghost-examined-2 = Even in death, you cannot escape the hospitality industry.
punpun-ghost-examined-3 = I would offer you a drink, but I suspect your corporeal limitations would complicate matters.
punpun-ghost-examined-4 = Tell me, does the afterlife offer paid leave?
punpun-ghost-examined-5 = Fascinating. Even the deceased have more leisure time than I do.
